// Name grammar of the universe (read by crates/world/src/names.rs, validated at first use).
//
// - voices: syllable generators (start + optional mid + end) for the roots of places.
// - words: named word lists, used by the patterns as {w:id}. A culture may redefine a list.
// - patterns: per kind of thing, a weighted list of forms. Tokens:
//     {root} {root2}  root(s) built from the voice (the culture's own one when a culture is given)
//     {gr} greek letter   {rom} roman numeral (1-12)   {n} 1-99   {n3} 100-999   {n4} 1000-9999
//     {cat} catalogue code (KX-2231)   {l} capital letter   {idx} roman numeral of the index
//     {idx_l} lowercase letter of the index (b, c, d...)   {host} name of the parent object
//     {label} what the object is (anomalies)   {given} {surname} {person}  a person of the culture
//     {w:id} a word of the list `id`
//   " de " / " le " / " la " followed by a vowel are elided (de + Alpha -> d'Alpha).
// - cultures: the people names (given = start + optional mid + end, by sex; surname likewise
//   with an optional particle), nicknames, titles, and the culture's own place voice and words.
//
// Allowed characters: letters (French accents too), digits, space, hyphen, apostrophe, point
// (everything the 5x7 font draws). Lists are validated when the file is first used.
(
 voices: [
  (id:"stellar",
   start:["Ka","Ro","Ven","Ta","Zi","Ur","Mel","Dor","An","Sei","Lu","Ax","Or","Ith","El","Vas","Nor","Qui","Ba","Sha","Tor","Eri","Cal","Hy","Pol","Sir","Alt","Rig","Den","Cap","Bel","Fom","Gia","Han","Ira","Jun","Kep","Lyr","Mir","Nas","Oph","Pav","Rus","Sab","Tau","Uma","Vir","Wez","Xen","Yed","Zav","Aud","Cor","Dra","Eph","Gor"],
